h a meeting room and laundry room.","short_summary":"A second-floor study area in the upperclass Gries Hall residence.","evidence_claim":"Saint Norbert lists a second-floor study area among Gries Hall's building amenities.","source_url":"https://my.snc.edu/reh/gries-hall/","source_title":"Gries Hall - Residential Education and Housing","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For Gries Hall residents; the hall is an upperclass, apartment-style living option under 11.5-month leases.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"snc-mmm-first-floor-group-study-lounge","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Mary Minahan McCormick Hall First-Floor Group-Study Lounge","title":"MMM First-Floor Group-Study Lounge","subtitle":"Mary Minahan McCormick Hall · 110 Reid St.","notes":"Meet classmates in MMM's large first-floor group-study lounge when you need a shared residential setting. Keep it available for residents who need a communal work area.","short_summary":"A large group-study lounge on MMM Hall's first floor.","evidence_claim":"Saint Norbert states that MMM Hall has one large group-study lounge on its first floor.","source_url":"https://my.snc.edu/reh/mmm-hall/","source_title":"Mary Minahan McCormick Hall","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For MMM Hall residents; this is a campus residence hall with a required meal plan based on housing classification.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"snc-madlor-lower-level-study-lounge","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Madelaine/Lorraine Hall Lower-Level Study Lounge","title":"Mad/Lor Lower-Level Study Lounge","subtitle":"Madelaine/Lorraine Hall · 190 Reid St.","notes":"Head to the shared lower-level study lounge for a 